  "description": "Lecce publishes complementary road-crash summaries for 2013, 2015, 2017, 2019 and 2021. The 2013 package groups street, time and incident-type tables. The 2015 package covers severity, injuries, vehicles, weather, locations, intersections, ages and vulnerable road users. The existing 2017 package has several overlapping dimensions; 2019 components cover weather and age by severity, and the 2021 member describes crash number and severity. These are source-labelled views of the same municipal crash-statistics series, without proof of continuous yearly coverage, identical schemas or disjoint events. Tables must not be summed across dimensions. CSV/spreadsheet links are listed; some 2013 resources have OP_DATPRO labels but descriptions say JSON. Actual counts, personal details and file bodies were not read. The licence is CC BY 4.0. File-use costs, present availability and completeness remain unknown. No specific related model, platform or completed simulation is documented.",
